{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "ACTV-08. Terms the Autonomous Ops screens, labels, messages and route descriptions never use. Read by backend/tests/test_autonomous_ops_copy.py and src/__tests__/autonomousOpsCopy.test.ts; patterns are applied line by line with Python re and JavaScript RegExp, flags are 'i' (case-insensitive) or empty. A line containing unlessLineContains (any case) is exempt from that rule. The files list names single files; the directories list names folders whose .py (backend) and .ts and .tsx (frontend) files are all scanned, walked recursively, and a listed folder that is missing or holds no such file fails the test.",
